{
  "slug": "claude-english-buddy",
  "name": "Claude English Buddy",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A UserPromptSubmit hook that helps non-native English speakers improve while using Claude Code. Three modes dispatch automatically based on what you type: (1) correct — if your English prompt has errors, the hook fixes them and shows a per-line `wrong → right (reason)` diff so you learn the rule, not just the fix; (2) translate — if the input is non-English (Chinese, Japanese, Spanish, etc.), it's translated into natural English while preserving technical terms, file paths, and tool names; (3) refine — prefix `::` rewrites a rough idea into a precise prompt. Local JSONL history powers /today, /stats, /mistakes reports, and a /drill spot-quiz on top recurring patterns. Skills cover grammar, punctuation, tone, technical writing, and common L2-English mistakes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 agents**, **7 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Agents** (4): `clarity-enhancer` (Sentence-level clarity review — flags run-on sentences, ambiguous references, deeply nested clauses, and terminology drift), `grammar-checker` (Fast mechanical grammar and punctuation check — flags spelling, agreement, tense, article, preposition, and punctuation errors against established…), `tone-calibrator` (Judgement-heavy tone evaluation — given a text and its destination (commit / PR / doc / email /…), `writing-reviewer` (Deep English text reviewer — orchestrates three specialist subagents (grammar-checker, tone-calibrator, clarity-enhancer) and merges their findings into one…)\n- **Commands** (7): `config` (Configure claude-english-buddy — set language, strictness, toggle auto-correction), `drill` (Spot-quiz on your top recurring English mistakes — presents one sentence per drill round with an intentional error…), `mistakes` (Your top recurring English mistakes — all-time patterns that need attention), `preview` (Dry-run review — show what WOULD be corrected in a prompt WITHOUT submitting it or triggering auto-correction), `review` (Deep English review of any text — commit messages, PR descriptions, docs, emails), `stats` (Long-term correction trends — error rate over time, most common mistakes, improvement trajectory), `today` (Today's language report — corrections made, recurring mistakes, lessons, and improvement trend)\n- **Hooks** (2): `UserPromptSubmit`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-english-buddy@claude-community` from `xiaolai/claude-english-buddy-for-claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "agent": 4,
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 7
  },
